THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND ATTRIBUTION
======================================

This repository contains configuration, detection logic and documentation. It
does not redistribute any Elastic, Microsoft or other vendor software binaries.
Those are downloaded directly from vendor distribution points at setup time.

