  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Licensed under the Sysinternals EULA.
  Downloaded at install time from https://download.sysinternals.com/files/Sysmon.zip
  The Sysmon schema referenced in sysmon/sysmon-config.xml was obtained from the
  installed binary via `sysmon64.exe -? config` (see sysmon/README.md).

